             +"<h2>Learning outcomes</h2><section>"+list_html(["Derive and compute cosmological redshift, FLRW distances, and distance-modulus relations with assumptions and units.","Explain how SNe Ia, BAO, CMB anisotropies, weak lensing, and clustering constrain different combinations of cosmological parameters.","Use covariance-aware likelihood calculations and distinguish measurement, derived quantity, and model-dependent inference.","Assess calibration, selection, nuisance parameters, and model assumptions in a published cosmological result.","Build reproducible analyses with source provenance, pinned software, numerical checks, and explicit limitations.","Communicate a claim whose strength matches the data and likelihood actually available."]) + "</section>"
